# Syntax error in `hci_helpers.svh` in Vivado

- Source URL: https://github.com/pulp-platform/hci/issues/26

The helper macros in `hci_helpers.svh` https://github.com/pulp-platform/hci/blob/82dfd3ffe0c4d9ef77c9a6d4efbbb0411aa2662e/rtl/common/hci_helpers.svh#L19-L38 distinguish between synthesis and simulation tools with a `ifdef SYNTHESIS` due to different supported features of SystemVerilog. Apparently, Vivado likes the same syntax of simulation tools, which is not the one currently selected.

